      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-28T01:01:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As I mentioned in the thread on the weekly oneshot, I came across strange behavior with these three cards. &nbsp;Easy to replicate on the environment's second turn, assuming that Unity plays Supply Crate (to draw Bee Bot) and the mine is destroyed before she plays it.</p><p>Mysterious Ceremonies plays Mysterious Ceremonies, which plays Master of the Temple. &nbsp;Environment plays poisoner. &nbsp;Mysterious Ceremonies allows Unity to play Bee Bot. &nbsp;Master of the Temple destroys one of Plague Rats handlers, which causes True Form to play Shinobi Assassin, which destroys Bee Bot. &nbsp;Bee Bot destroys True Form. &nbsp;Master of the Temple continues to allow the already completely destroyed True Form to deal damage?!?</p><p>Bug? &nbsp;(Also, when dealing the damage afterwards the game says \"Could not calculate preview.\")</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:49:49.156Z",
