      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-28T02:02:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Last year I had submitted an e-mail to Handelabra on an very similar situation - True Form gets destroyed in the middle of Master of the Temple. &nbsp;At the time, the game functionally did as expected - the remaining damage from Master of the Temple was stopped. &nbsp;But I did get a funny message \"The True Form prevented the True Form from dealing damage\" so I submitted that screenshot. &nbsp;Never heard any follow up - the game was still functionally correct so I'm sure the odd message was low priority.</p><p>Anyway, looks like the game functionality has changed since.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:29:04.908Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
