      "raw": "<p>Last year I had submitted an e-mail to Handelabra on an very similar situation - True Form gets destroyed in the middle of Master of the Temple. &nbsp;At the time, the game functionally did as expected - the remaining damage from Master of the Temple was stopped. &nbsp;But I did get a funny message &quot;The True Form prevented the True Form from dealing damage&quot; so I submitted that screenshot. &nbsp;Never heard any follow up - the game was still functionally correct so I&#39;m sure the odd message was low priority.</p><p>Anyway, looks like the game functionality has changed since.</p>",
